INSERT INTO `pgs_and_speedo_meter_units_fixing` VALUES (1,37016,'14_0','WAP-7','CCB','ER','Howrah(HWHE)','2025-08-20','PG1 and PG2 Installation:Ensure that PG1(Left from LP of CAB1) and PG2 (Right from LP of CAB1) are installed on allotted axles (WAP5=wheel 2and3, WAP7=whee2and5) of locomotives on left and right side.','PG1 are installed on\n wheel no 5\n PG2 are installed on\n wheel no 2.','14.1','Installed','2025-08-21 06:35:18','2026-07-03 10:43:37',NULL),(2,37016,'14_0','WAP-7','CCB','ER','Howrah(HWHE)','2025-08-20','Washer Insertion:Verify that M12 spring is correctly inserted in the drive pin.','Verified using M12 spring\n washer','14.2','Yes','2025-08-21 06:35:18','2026-07-03 10:43:37',NULL),(3,37016,'14_0','WAP-7','CCB','ER','Howrah(HWHE)','2025-08-20','Drive Pin Fixing: Ensure drive pin length before installation as per Loco type,(loco type WAP7=60 mm, WAP5=76mm, EMU=90mm). Ensure the drive pin is securely fixed with LOCTITE 542. Verify that the torque applied is 76N·m using a calibrated torque wrench.','WAP7 60mm drive pin\n used also using Loctite\n 542.','14.3','Torquing done','2025-08-21 06:35:18','2026-07-03 10:43:37',NULL),(4,37016,'14_0','WAP-7','CCB','ER','Howrah(HWHE)','2025-08-20','Gasket Lock Plate Placement:Ensure the Gasket Lock Plate is correctly positioned on the axle cover without any misalignment.','Checked and verified','14.4','Positioning done','2025-08-21 06:35:18','2026-07-03 10:43:37',NULL),(5,37016,'14_0','WAP-7','CCB','ER','Howrah(HWHE)','2025-08-20','PG Coupler Ring Placement: Verify that PG coupler ring is positioned correctly on the gasket. Ensure that the label (PG1 / PG2) is clearly visible at the top end.','Checked positions of PG\n 1\n and 2 are ok','14.5','Positioning done','2025-08-21 06:35:18','2026-07-03 10:43:37',NULL),(6,37016,'14_0','WAP-7','CCB','ER','Howrah(HWHE)','2025-08-20','Coupler Ring Alignment:Confirm that the selected PG (PG1 / PG2) determines the alignment of four out of eight holes with the axle cover.','','