PG2 Insertion: Ensure PG1 / PG2 is inserted correctly into the axle cover. Confirm that driving fork is aligned with the drive pin before proceeding.','','14.9','Select','2026-07-04 10:48:08','2026-07-04 10:48:08',NULL),(1764,6786,'14.0','WAP-9','CCB','ER','Howrah(HWHE)','2026-07-04','PG Alignment:Ensure that all eight holes on PG align perfectly with holes on the gasket and coupler ring.','','14.10','Select','2026-07-04 10:48:08','2026-07-04 10:48:08',NULL),(1765,6786,'14.0','WAP-9','CCB','ER','Howrah(HWHE)','2026-07-04','PG Fixing with M8 Bolts: Check that the M8×25mm bolts are properly installed with LOCTITE 542. Ensure both spring and plain washers are used.','','14.11','Select','2026-07-04 10:48:08','2026-07-04 10:48:08',NULL),(1766,6786,'14.0','WAP-9','CCB','ER','Howrah(HWHE)','2026-07-04','M8 Bolt Torque Check:Verify that all M8 bolts are tightened to 25 N.m using a calibrated torque wrench.Marking with green/yellow paint.','','14.12','Select','2026-07-04 10:48:08','2026-07-04 10:48:08',NULL),(1767,6786,'14.0','WAP-9','CCB','ER','Howrah(HWHE)','2026-07-04','Final Position Check:Ensure that the final installed positions of PG1 and PG2 match the specified locations.','','14.13','Select','2026-07-04 10:48:08','2026-07-04 10:48:08',NULL),(1768,6786,'14.0','WAP-9','CCB','ER','Howrah(HWHE)','2026-07-04','Cable routing:Ensure that PG cables routing made properly with metal clamps / cable ties','','14.14','Select','2026-07-04 10:48:08','2026-07-04 10:48:08',NULL),(1769,6786,'14.0','WAP-9','CCB','ER','Howrah(HWHE)','2026-07-04','Speedometer Boxes fixing: Is each Speedometer Interface Unit mounted on the locomotive chassis near its corresponding Pulse Generator?','','14.15','Select','2026-07-04 10:48:08','2026-07-04 10:48:08',NULL),(1770,6786,'14.0','WAP-9','CCB','ER','Howrah(HWHE)','2026-07-04','Speedometer Boxes fixing: Is the Speedometer Interface Unit orientation such that cables connect to the Pulse Generator on one side and the Loco Kavach Unit on the other side 